Description: Hadith-based Islamic prayer time calculator
 Computes prayer windows and the three forbidden intervals from solar
 geometry, following the hadith literature. Provides a command-line tool
 (prayer-times) and a Qt GUI (prayer-times-gui) with fixed-angle, PCD
 dynamic-angle and NREL SPA modes. SPA mode needs pandas, pytz and pvlib.
